{"about_the_game":"Created by passionate students at the University of Utah.<br><br>Dive into <i>No Strings Attached</i>, a puzzle platform thriller where you play as Pavo, a newlysentient puppet trying to escape from an abandoned circus. Marionette Pavo\u2019s arms to swing, climb, and more as you are guided by a mysterious Blue Light to the Big Top. Unravel your Master\u2019s true intentions in this captivating, Pinocchio-inspired adventure.<br><br><strong>MARIONETTE THROUGH PUZZLES</strong><br>Raise Pavo\u2019s arms and use the push and balance poses to navigate the puzzles you will encounter along the way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/62e3adb0944b2ba68a614a53b5b6505a.poster.avif?t=1759088139\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/62e3adb0944b2ba68a614a53b5b6505a.webm?t=1759088139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/62e3adb0944b2ba68a614a53b5b6505a.mp4?t=1759088139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>EXPLORE THE CIRCUS</strong><br>Explore the Puppet Master\u2019s struggling circus where Pavo and other creations were created.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/933ff54b2d63b2fbf3d70d54d836bc00.poster.avif?t=1759088139\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/933ff54b2d63b2fbf3d70d54d836bc00.webm?t=1759088139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/933ff54b2d63b2fbf3d70d54d836bc00.mp4?t=1759088139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><br>UNCOVER YOUR MASTER\u2019S SECRET</strong><br>Find out what actually goes on in Puppet Master\u2019s circus and what will happen when he finds one of his creations is sentient.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/e7abd35efa6aaf796d27e41fb8cac9fc.poster.avif?t=1759088139\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/e7abd35efa6aaf796d27e41fb8cac9fc.webm?t=1759088139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/extras/e7abd35efa6aaf796d27e41fb8cac9fc.mp4?t=1759088139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716540?t=1759088139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759088139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759088139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759088139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Created by passionate students at the University of Utah.<br><br>Dive into <i>No Strings Attached</i>, a puzzle platform thriller where you play as Pavo, a newlysentient puppet trying to escape from an abandoned circus. Marionette Pavo\u2019s arms to swing, climb, and more as you are guided by a mysterious Blue Light to the Big Top. Unravel your Master\u2019s true intentions in this captivating, Pinocchio-inspired adventure.<br><br><strong>MARIONETTE THROUGH PUZZLES</strong><br>Raise 